# Tasks for FinanzasDaniel v0.2: Functional Onboarding

## Phase 1: Core Logic Layer & Persistence
- [ ] Create `AppState.swift` as an `@Observable` singleton following `speckit.plan`.
- [ ] Create `BudgetCalculator.swift` with pure functions for budget estimation.
- [ ] Implement `MonthlySnapshot` SwiftData model in `Models/MonthlySnapshot.swift`.
